Release: canonical Oblige web Scores route and mobile tab, 2026-09-21

This file exists only as the watched Railway deployment trigger for the oblige-web
service. The customer-facing change adds /scores to the actual Next.js frontend served
through obligeprops.com, adds Scores to the desktop/mobile navigation, and uses the
existing /api/live ESPN-first/Sportradar-fallback score mesh.

No auth, billing, prop quote precedence, provider secrets, or database schema changes.
